@host = http://localhost:3000

### register — 201
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Marko","email":"agent@test.rs","password":"tajnalozinka"}

### register duplikat — 409
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Marko","email":"marko@test.rs","password":"tajnalozinka"}

### register nevalidan — 400
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"X","email":"nijeemail","password":"123"}

### login — 200 + token
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"marko@test.rs","password":"tajnalozinka"}

### login pogresna lozinka — 401
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"marko@test.rs","password":"pogresno"}

### login nepostojeci email — 401 (ista poruka)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"nema@test.rs","password":"tajnalozinka"}

### me — 200
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### me bez tokena — 401
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me

### me sa smecem — 401
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer abc.def.ghi